{"id":"und","lemma":"und","pos":"conj","rank":9,"glosses":["and","links two nouns, often a person and an activity, in rhetoric questions to express an opposition between them"],"ipa":"/ʊnt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/08/De-und.ogg/De-und.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Komm und sieh.","en":"Come and see.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/470048","words":[{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},null,{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"}]},{"text":"Und was ist dann passiert?","en":"And then what happened?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755884","words":[null,{"g":"what"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"then, after that"},{"g":"to happen","l":"passieren"}]},{"text":"Und warum sollte ich das tun?","en":"And why would I do that?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759776","words":[null,{"g":"why"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to do"}]},{"text":"Ich geh und hol es.","en":"I'll go get it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/701083","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},null,{"g":"to get, to fetch","l":"holen"},{"g":"it"}]},{"text":"Ich werde kommen und dich holen.","en":"I'll come and get you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/695656","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"to come"},null,{"g":"you","l":"du"},{"g":"to get, to fetch"}]}]}